{"server":"jp","storyId":"main_3_level_main_03-03_beg","groupId":"main_3","stageId":"main_03-03","title":"旋回","storyCode":"3-3","avgTag":"戦闘前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/jp/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_03-03_beg.txt","sourceHash":"393bc7bdcac4c2cd6db170ac23d5a88f519c476c4ec337b9eb57579491dd8580","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"エクシアとテキサスが敵陣で騒ぎを起こし、注意を引いてくれている。\nその間にロドスも到着し、戦いへと身を投じるのだった。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第二十五关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_a"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"くそっ……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"怯えるな、敵はたったの二人だ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"さっさと仕留めて――"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"くっ……もう二十人は犠牲になってるぞ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"あいつら、普通の相手じゃねえ……！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"エクシア","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"テキサス、右！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"テキサス","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"右？　あいにく、今は手一杯だ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"――そいつを抑え込め！　俺がトドメを刺してやる！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"テキサス","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"カバーは任せた。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"エクシア","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"そんじゃ代わりに、つめた～い飲み物でも奢ってくれる～？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"テキサス","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"ああ。だから早くしろ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"エクシア","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"りょうか～い！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"エクシア","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"さ～て、そこのお兄さん？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"あぁ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"エクシア","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"キミに弾丸をプレゼントするから、ちゃ～んと受け取ってね！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"は？　プレゼント、って……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"ぐあっ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"エクシア","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"はい、一丁上がり～！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"テキサス","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"感謝する。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"こ、この女っ……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"だが、剣さえ封じときゃこっちのもん――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"テキサス","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"悪いが、そうはいかない。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"テキサス","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"――私の剣は、もう一振りあるんでな。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"う、うわああっ！"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_a"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"エクシア","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"よーし！　これで全員片付けたかな？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"エクシア","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"にしても、あたしたちのコンビって息ぴったりだよね！　まさに阿吽の呼吸ってやつ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"テキサス","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"……そうだな。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_a"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"いたぞ、逃がすな！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"テキサス","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"増援か。数が多いな。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"テキサス","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"まあ、あれほど派手にやれば当然か。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"くそっ……！！　なんなんだよ、この状況は……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"お前ら、一体どうしてこんな真似をした！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"エクシア","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"ん～、キミたちに恨みはないんだけど……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"エクシア","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"仕事は仕事だからさ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"エクシア","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"一度契約した以上、しっかりそれを遂行するのが物流業界の基本っていうか――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"テキサス","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"エクシア、左だ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"エクシア","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"えっ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"エクシア","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"って、うわわ……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"エクシア","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"ごめん、ありがと！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"テキサス","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"ああ。――右の連中は任せた。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"テキサス","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"走るぞ、そろそろ潮時だ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":true,"text":"エクシアさん、聞こえますか？　もうじき、そちらに到着します！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"エクシア","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"了解！　向こうさんはあたしたちに気を取られてるし、動き方はお任せするね！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":true,"text":"はい！　お二人も、どうかお気をつけて！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"フランカさん、目標地点には到着しましたか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フランカ","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":true,"text":"ええ、準備OKよ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"リスカム","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":true,"text":"――こちらリスカム。我々重装部隊も、配置についています。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"わかりました。――オペレーター各位、注意してください。敵狙撃手が地形を利用して身を隠している可能性がありますので。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"自分の立ち位置には気をつけつつ、狙撃手優先で、攻撃をお願いします。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"では……皆さん、奇襲の準備を。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……救出対象の安全のためにも、やりすぎないよう注意してくださいね。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["アーミヤ"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["レユニオン構成員"]},{"speakerId":"char_102_texas","aliases":["テキサス"]},{"speakerId":"char_103_angel","aliases":["エクシア"]},{"speakerId":"char_106_franka","aliases":["フランカ"]},{"speakerId":"char_107_liskam","aliases":["リスカム"]}]}
